  << /ActualText (Hello Dear\054\050Thank you for buying this After Effect Template \041\n\nZip contains AE file\056 It\031s really easy to customize \072\n\nEdit the effect in folder \034\043Render\035 \074 Layer \074 \034CHANGE EFFECT HERE\041\041\041\035\nImport your photo or video\056 Open the Scene Folder \074 \034EDIT\052\035 FOLDER \074 \034PLACEHOLDER\041\041\041\035\056 \240 \240 Drag your image into the comp and scale it as you need\056\nTo change to color\054 open the folder \034To Edit\035 to change color\054 select the layer named \034COLOR EFFECT HERE\041\041\041\035 and change the color to your needs\nAfter that\054 render composition \034\043Render\035 on folder master edit to get the final result\n\050\nProject features\072\nFlexible control\nEasy to customize\nFast render\n100\045 After Effects\nAfter Effects CC20 and above\nNo plugins required\n\nMusic\072\n)
